# The release job and the install scripts run on Linux and macOS.
# CRLF in a shebang fails with "bash\r: No such file or directory".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.so binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
